# Config bans Sleep and TFile.Delete. Hits: bare call (12), qualified call (13).
# Non-hits: other TFile method (14), longer identifier SleepEx (15), comment (16),
# string (17), the routine declaration itself (20).
disallowed-method 12
disallowed-method 13
!disallowed-method 14
!disallowed-method 15
!disallowed-method 16
!disallowed-method 17
!disallowed-method 20
